In this lab I will demonstrate how to jailbreak(semi-untethered) 
an Iphone 12 Mini using information gathering and running exploits.
A semi-untethered jailbreak's access disappears after the device restarts. 
IOS security is designed so that root access is removed and userland exploits 
do not persist across reboots.
______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________-
Tools & Websites Used

Jailbreaking Tool: Dopamine
Website Used for Information Gathering: https://gsmarena.com/
Website Used to Find Compatible Jailbreaking Tool: https://theapplewiki.com/wiki/Jailbreak
Command Used: ./TrollRestore (Used to rebuild parts of the iOS filesystem and enables 
limited access to app data)
TrollStore: App installer which allows installation of unsigned applications on iOS
______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________
In order to jailbreak a mobile device, we must meet specific requirements to be successful.
1. Device information
2. A publicly known vulnerability tied to the device information(.e.g.,Operating System Version)
3. Find a compatible jailbreaking tool
We must then connect the mobile device to a pc in order to get initial access and send data.
Run the exploit tool and install the malicious software.
